*> ********************************************************
*> PROGRAM : FRD0050
*> PURPOSE : FRAUD SCORING RULES
*> AUTHOR  : D.P.
*> CHANGE LOG:
*>   1992-02-10 ORIGINAL VERSION
*>   2003-10-09 THRESHOLDS UPDATED PER AUDIT REQ 880
*> RUN FROM JCL JOB FRDNIGHT STEP050
*> ********************************************************
IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. FRD0050.
DATA DIVISION.
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
01 WS-INPUT.
    *> TRANSACTIONS IN LAST 24 HOURS
    05 TXN-COUNT-24H      PIC 9(3).
    05 TXN-AMOUNT         PIC 9(7)V99.
    *> DAYS SINCE ACCOUNT OPENED
    05 ACCT-OPEN-DAYS     PIC 9(5).
01 WS-OUT-REC.
    05 RISK-LEVEL         PIC X VALUE 'L'.
    05 FRAUD-SCORE        PIC 9(3) VALUE ZERO.
PROCEDURE DIVISION.
0000-MAIN.
    ACCEPT WS-INPUT
    PERFORM RATE-ACTIVITY
    DISPLAY "RISK-LEVEL=" RISK-LEVEL
    DISPLAY "FRAUD-SCORE=" FRAUD-SCORE
    STOP RUN.
RATE-ACTIVITY.
    EVALUATE TRUE
        *> VERY HIGH TRANSACTION VELOCITY - LIMIT 12 PER 1998 POLICY
        WHEN TXN-COUNT-24H > 25 AND TXN-AMOUNT > 8000
            MOVE 'H' TO RISK-LEVEL
            MOVE 90 TO FRAUD-SCORE
        WHEN TXN-COUNT-24H GREATER THAN 12
            MOVE 'M' TO RISK-LEVEL
            MOVE 60 TO FRAUD-SCORE
        *> ACTIVITY ON NEW ACCOUNT - LIMIT 15 PER 1998 POLICY
        WHEN ACCT-OPEN-DAYS < 30
            MOVE 'M' TO RISK-LEVEL
            MOVE 40 TO FRAUD-SCORE
        WHEN OTHER
            MOVE 'L' TO RISK-LEVEL
            MOVE 10 TO FRAUD-SCORE
    END-EVALUATE.
